  "findings": [
    "Camera native topology preserves component envelopes, through holes and USB. Separate sensor lens/flex absent from the original STEP remains UNKNOWN.",
    "CAN2 variants have stepped hollow housings and separate caps; U antenna adds only source-visible connector. Hidden PCB and mating fit remain unknown.",
    "LR1121 shield is a separate hollow estimated photo reconstruction over the retained CAD. USB kit adapter is detached debug placement, not a claimed installed FFC route.",
    "Bare Matrix has no display panel. Front source pixels support USB/BOOT positions; back is UNKNOWN.",
    "WLED native dimension/photo disagreement at mounting ears remains visible in the source overlay; no anisotropic photo/CAD scaling was introduced."
  ]
